WEBVTT

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:44.760
Top!

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:45.750
What?

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:47.250
Those guys from Blanc ring...

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:57.020
Blanc Ring... So this bastard's Blanc Wolf, huh?!

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.730
Don't look down on me!

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:00.250
Ochre Ring...

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:10.320
Oh, what's this?!

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:12.140
You have serious frostbite.

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:13.110
Get inside!

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:16.840
I-I'm a messenger from Night Ring.

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:18.530
I have to see your top...

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:20.950
A messenger? In this snow?

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:22.570
You need to be tended to first.

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:25.250
D-Don't worry; quickly... to Top...

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:26.210
What's the matter?

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:34.750
Second!

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:38.080
The rumour about the woman from Sun Ring... is it true?

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.600
Yes. So, what do you want?

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:44.290
I've come to deliver a message from Nights Ring's Top, Jeso.

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:47.290
A message? Delivering an urgent message at this time of night?

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:48.930
In that case...

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:51.880
Top!

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:54.230
That silver hair...

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:57.650
You are...

00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:00.860
Ochre Ring's Top, Thor?

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:03.820
It's fine, I'll listen.

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:07.550
Night Ring was taken by Blanc Ring?

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:09.640
Your Top Jeso?

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:10.920
Died in the battle.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:15.760
2 days ago people from the Blanc Ring started making trouble in our territory,

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:18.470
but we never thought they would launch a night attack.

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:20.790
Today was certainly a day they would chose;

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:24.470
It's minus 40 degrees; no one would think about battle.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:27.230
So your carelessness has also been calculated into their plan.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:30.810
Silver Hawk Thor, Jeso wanted you to have this.

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:35.400
Top's symbol, Ring Tiara.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:37.930
They didn't take it?

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:41.080
Blanc Wolf treated this as if it were nothing.

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:42.800
Blanc Wolf...

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:46.100
At the time when you became Ochre Ring's Top,

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:48.940
in Blanc Ring, a new top was also born...

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:53.080
A brutal and cruel white wolf - Blanc Wolf.

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:58.020
What he want's... isn't Night Ring's participation;

00:04:58.350 --> 00:04:59.300
it's extermination!

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:00.450
What do you mean?

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:04.290
In order to control this planet you just need to become Jyu Oh, right?

00:05:04.730 --> 00:05:08.480
Which means, he's not aiming to become Jyu Oh.

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:11.280
Top, these were Jeso's last words:

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:15.220
<i>"Silver Hawk Thor is the only one who can stop White Wolf...</i>

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:16.750
<i>for the sake of Jyu Oh Sei."</i>

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:21.690
For the sake of Jyu Oh Sei, huh?

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:23.800
What a huge amount of trust he's put on you.

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:26.400
How old are you now, Thor?

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:27.390
15.

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:29.760
When the next Day cycle finishes, I'll be 16.

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:34.460
The silver hawk ruling the Ochre Ring - Silver Hawk Thor.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.580
The one who, at only 11 years old, became Top,

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:40.590
then won easily in the next 2 Tries,

00:05:41.350 --> 00:05:44.320
and doubled Ochre Ring's Territory.

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:47.050
Food and water is plentiful.

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:51.320
The thermal power generation system for air conditioners designed by Top himself is also successful.

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.910
No wonder you're <i>"Thor-sama-sama".</i>

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:56.000
What are you trying to say?

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:58.620
Do you want your bones buried here on Chimera?

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:04.460
As the greatest Top, leaving your name in this planet's history isn't bad, is it?

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:09.760
Since I became Top, I've wanted everyone to live in good conditions.

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:12.260
On this cruel planet,

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:15.430
killing over the lack of water and food is too foolish.

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:19.800
But, every day, I've never forgotten...

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:22.190
the image of my father and mother's deaths,

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:24.730
nor the despair I experienced together with Rai.

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:27.740
Since the day we were been abandoned on this planet, every day; I never forgotten!

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:29.720
That's good.

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:32.230
You will definitely become Jyu Oh.

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:35.300
Understand? Now is your chance.

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:36.420
Chance?

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:39.800
Blanc Wolf's next target is the Sun Ring, right?

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:42.270
It'll be to our advantage, no matter who falls.

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:45.810
You'll be able to become Jyu Oh with a single move.

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:48.310
Are you telling me not to care about what Blanc Wolf does?

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:49.670
That's impossible!

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:52.670
On the top of that, if Sun Ring also falls...

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:55.280
even the Jyu Oh Sei system might collapse.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:58.350
Of course. That's a reasonable assumption.

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:01.740
Most importantly, I don't want be that inhumane.

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:02.640
Inhumane?

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:07.260
Oi oi, you  want to become Jyu Oh and leave Chimera, don't you?

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:10.500
I'll leave this planet as a human being!

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:13.100
I don't want to become a beast!

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:14.670
Thor!

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:17.330
AA message from Sun Ring's Top Yuuki has arrived.

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:19.830
It seems he's going to the site of Sapa's village.

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:21.880
He wants to confer with us there.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:23.860
Sun Ring's Yuuki...

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:27.640
It must be urgent if Top himself is going.

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:29.140
What shall we do?

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:30.550
Of course we'll go.

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:33.020
If Thor's going, I'm going too.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:36.560
And he wants Third to come as well.

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:37.430
Me?

00:07:41.090 --> 00:07:42.980
Yuuki, what kind of person is he?

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:44.880
Yuuki's really strong.

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:48.530
People say that most likely to become Jyu Oh out of the four Tops.

00:07:48.890 --> 00:07:52.520
No, I mean what's he like in character and personality?

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:57.800
His character? Well... he is huge, and like a father figure.

00:07:58.020 --> 00:07:58.830
A father?

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:02.890
That's the site of Saba's village.

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:13.630
During the last Day cycle Verasona's propagation was abnormal.

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:16.380
Everything around here was destroyed.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:25.680
Silver Hawk! Thank goodness you've come!

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:26.560
Where's Yuuki?

00:08:26.890 --> 00:08:28.020
He's waiting inside.

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:32.810
Thor, is it?

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:33.690
Yeah.

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:35.330
I've been wanting to meet you.

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:39.350
Yeah, you really are Silver Hawk. How incredible your hair colour is.

00:08:39.670 --> 00:08:41.350
It was altered to be silver.

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:42.660
I see.

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:45.300
Well, you look good. It suits you.

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:49.730
No wonder you're the man that wild Tiz fell for.

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:52.070
Who's wild?! You...

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:56.690
So Yuuki, what did you want to discuss?

00:08:57.320 --> 00:09:01.410
Nothing except the issue of that guy called the Blanc Wolf.

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:05.800
I heard it from those people who escaped.

00:09:06.450 --> 00:09:09.890
He's going to attack Sun Ring and Ochre Ring one day too.

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.210
I can't just let that happen.

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:14.410
Shall we declare a war together?

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:17.590
You mean fight together in order to beat Blanc Wolf?

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:20.350
Blanc Ring is still small and weak.

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:23.280
If we get rid of Blanc Wolf, everything will be finished.

00:09:24.050 --> 00:09:27.230
Yuuki, do you have any information about Blanc Wolf?

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:32.270
He's a white criminal from outside, about 18 or 19 years old.

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:36.810
Blanc Ring is in a remote place. Information about them is very limited.

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:40.200
That's why the people of Night Ring didn't pay much attention to them.

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:44.280
Getting into Blanc Ring's territory, even during the Day cycle, is very difficult.

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:47.860
There were people from Blanc Ring who also died making the journey to Night Ring, right?

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:50.190
I don't understand why they would go to such extremes.

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:51.960
There's no reason;

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:53.590
they just want to fight.

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:55.500
This must be the only reason.

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:58.510
A top like that, why would everyone follow him?

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:01.900
It's because he must have something which people won't be able to oppose.

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:04.420
On this planet there are killings everyday,

00:10:04.690 --> 00:10:08.430
but, even among these killings, there are rules which shouldn't be broken.

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:12.520
l definitely cannot forgive Blanc Wolf's methods.

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:16.590
That guy will definitely do something again tonight.

00:10:17.150 --> 00:10:20.360
Let's lure him into my territory and attack him on both flanks.

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:24.290
Third, there's something I'd like to ask of you...

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:26.360
It's about Chen.

00:10:30.300 --> 00:10:32.700
Chen,.. it's been four years since I saw her.

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:34.410
You heard right?

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:38.210
4 years ago in that duel, she did win...

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:41.500
However, at that time, because of the injury, one of her legs had to be amputated.

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:45.420
From here go to the east; in the abandoned village, she's waiting for you.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:48.550
Please go and see her.

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:00.660
I... still can't believe it.

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:03.310
How could Chen have been injured by Ilza?!

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:06.340
That girl; she couldn't be the women's Top anymore because of her injury,

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:08.440
so she left, and stays with the men of Sun Ring now.

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:11.890
But she has too much pride...

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:16.340
She hardly eats now. She's wasting away.

00:11:17.430 --> 00:11:20.900
If it's you speaking to her, she might listen...

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:23.930
Please, go and encourage her.

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:27.130
Yuuki, don't tell me that you like Chen?

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:28.670
Don't be stupid!

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:30.220
She's a comrade in our Ring!

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:32.410
Because she's a comrade, I cant leave her on her own!

00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:35.550
Just go, Third.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:37.470
Well.. I don't mind.

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:38.730
Top!

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:40.600
What is it?

00:11:40.890 --> 00:11:44.350
It's Chen-san. She said that she definitely doesn't want to see anyone.

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:46.350
She'll just walk back by herself...

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:48.600
Right now Lotta's trying to stop her.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:49.780
That idiot!

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:52.560
Third, please come with me!

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:55.110
/Chen said she doesn't want to see anyone.

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:59.280
It'll hurt her sense of pride if I go there now.

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:01.300
Third!

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.680
You are cold!

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:05.310
No... he might be right.

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:07.530
I'll go and stop her myself.

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.510
In that case, excuse me. Please wait a moment.

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:10.580
Yuuki.

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:17.210
Yuuki, I'm sorry we couldn't give you any help.

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:18.830
You really are strange.

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:21.130
It's not something that you need to apologise for.

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:24.980
But... I understand Chen's feelings.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:28.830
She doesn't want Third to see what she looks like now.

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:30.840
This is what <i>"a woman's heart"</i> is.

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:33.650
You really are kind.

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:34.810
Kind?

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:38.730
Do you know how many people I've killed so far?

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:43.590
I only want to protect the people who are important to me.

00:12:52.820 --> 00:12:55.320
You really are a demon sometimes!

00:12:55.490 --> 00:12:57.450
There's no point in me going.

00:12:58.220 --> 00:13:01.240
Hollow encouragement won't help Chen.

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:02.200
Still!

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:03.310
It can't be helped...

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:06.080
I already have one...

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:10.170
I have a woman who I truly love, from bottom of my heart.

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:13.420
In order to hold her with my own hands one day,

00:13:14.320 --> 00:13:16.300
I managed to survive in this hell.

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:19.260
Who? Where is that woman?

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:23.290
Far far away from here.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:24.890
Unexpected...

00:13:25.210 --> 00:13:26.090
I understand.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:27.950
But you still need to see Chen.

00:13:28.710 --> 00:13:31.270
Even if it's with hollow words, you should comfort her.

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:32.110
Let's go.

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:34.810
You get it, Third?

00:13:35.110 --> 00:13:36.460
It's Top's order.

00:13:36.780 --> 00:13:37.860
Yeah, yeah.

00:13:41.310 --> 00:13:43.570
Come on, think it over, Chen.

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.770
Third doesn't care about what happened to your leg.

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:49.870
You have an artificial limb. You look the same as before.

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:50.580
I know.

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:52.370
I know that.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:55.390
Third won't care... about anything.

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:59.820
Even if I were dead, he wouldn't care.

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:04.410
Yuuki, I really should leave the Ring.

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:05.550
Chen!

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:11.480
I'm not willing to bear anyone's child except Third's.

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:16.430
A woman in the Ring who won't have children...

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:18.150
will only be an burden.

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:20.890
To continue living is...

00:14:21.430 --> 00:14:23.520
Chen, I...

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:29.240
Chen, go up to the second floor and hide yourself!

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:37.770
As expected, Sun Ring really is preparing to make their move.

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:40.490
Yeah, as you said, Top.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:41.660
Top?

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:45.520
That means... this guy is Blanc Wolf?

00:14:52.130 --> 00:14:54.750
Blanc Wolf, you'll be in trouble if you underestimate me.

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:57.430
Above!

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:01.850
Yuuki, these are the only enemies!

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:02.850
3 of them left!

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:09.750
Shit! Attacked-

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:10.440
Wait.

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:14.950
Top! Wh-what are you...

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:16.020
That's dangerous!

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:22.990
Sun Ring's Yuuki, show yourself.

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:24.990
Let's have a boss battle here.

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:27.760
Interesting.

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:30.470
Yuuki, that's a trap!

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:31.440
Don't come out!

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:33.730
What's wrong?

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:37.600
Aren't you admirable; the one who wiped out Night Ring...

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:39.920
In Sun Ring, there are too many of you.

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:42.190
Everything will be easy after I defeat you.

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:44.050
What an irritating bastard...

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:46.910
You think you can beat me?!

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:51.890
Coming!

00:15:56.830 --> 00:15:58.020
What a guy...

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:01.310
Avoiding Yuuki's sword this fast...

00:16:05.930 --> 00:16:07.440
Look down on me, will you?

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:08.630
Why don't you use your sword?

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:12.300
If you have something to say, try to kill me first! I don't even have a scratch yet.

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:16.410
You damn... Great! Let me cut you up!

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:24.650
<i>He doesn't use his sword until the last minute.</i>

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:26.530
<i>Does he want to risk victory or defeat on that?</i>

00:16:26.850 --> 00:16:28.920
<i>But you can't do the same thing twice!</i>

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:38.180
Got you!

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:53.500
Victory is clear.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:56.910
Yuuki!

00:17:01.170 --> 00:17:02.060
You beast!

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:03.590
Concealing your sword...

00:17:04.320 --> 00:17:06.320
You broke the rule of battle!

00:17:06.870 --> 00:17:08.370
Chen, stop it!

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:10.540
There's no rule for beasts.

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:12.350
Winners become rulers.

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:13.470
Unforgivable!

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:14.750
I'll kill you!

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:20.330
Kevin, do it. She's an obstacle.

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:31.350
Yuuki... Yuuki!

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:35.690
Chen, live on!

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:36.680
Be... happy.

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:41.500
This is all I can do for my woman...

00:17:42.030 --> 00:17:45.670
Don't die, Yuuki! Don't die!

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:49.240
Are you crying... for my sake?

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.280
This is... really great.

00:17:55.610 --> 00:17:58.600
Yuuki! Yuuki!

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:04.750
Don't move!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:06.300
Drop your guns.

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:08.610
I'll kill you straight away if you dare bluff.

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:11.850
Hey, hey, throw them down.

00:18:12.220 --> 00:18:13.650
She's serious.

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.090
Throw it down, Kevin.

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:16.030
Top?

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:24.100
<i>This guy is Blanc Ring's Top.</i>

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:25.880
<i>Blanc Wolf.</i>

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:29.660
Tiz... Yuuki is...

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:32.990
Yuuki.. Damn it!

00:18:33.430 --> 00:18:34.750
You idiot!

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:41.780
<i>"I only want to protect the people who are important to me."</i>

00:18:47.340 --> 00:18:50.110
Blanc Wolf, you broke the rule of battle.

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:52.160
You need to pay for this sin.

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:56.240
Is obeying the rules really that important?

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:59.540
You have been totally affected by people in Chimera.

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:02.590
Back then you were more spirited.

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:06.090
You abandoned your brother in order to survive.

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:09.240
That's right, isn't it, Thor?

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:13.430
Zagi...

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:15.340
Zagi?

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:20.290
You've grown. I've been waiting the moment when I would meet you.

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:21.160
Why?

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:23.550
Why did you do such a stupid thing?!

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:27.870
In 24 hours, at Dagger Pagoda:

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:29.700
come alone and I'll tell you.

00:19:33.050 --> 00:19:33.910
A smoke bomb!

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:35.650
Top, now!

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:37.430
Top!

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:38.710
Crap!

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:39.410
Don't shoot.

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:41.310
Thor?

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:52.530
Well, we've fulfilled our purpose.

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:55.910
You and that guy are the only Tops left.

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:59.120
How can you say that with such a relaxed tone?

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:03.780
Zagi was right. I left Rai in the lurch.

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:08.440
I thought that in order to leave this planet, I could only obey the rules here.

00:20:09.280 --> 00:20:13.630
Become a Ring Top and become Jyu Oh... if that was the only way.

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:17.970
Yet... I hated Rai.

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:22.210
But as much as I hated him, I loved him.

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:31.930
If the love I had for Rai had outweighed my hatred towards him just a little more...

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:35.580
Blanc Wolf; is that guy the reason you're so confused?

00:20:37.640 --> 00:20:41.540
Zagi was clever and kind. He's not a beast.

00:20:42.310 --> 00:20:43.880
He's human being just like me.

00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:46.180
You don't understand, do you.

00:20:47.230 --> 00:20:50.470
Rather than as a beast, you want to leave this planet as a human-being, right?

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:52.360
Remember this,

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:56.390
human beings are the most horrible beasts of all.

00:20:58.460 --> 00:21:00.020
Don't trust Zagi.

00:21:01.670 --> 00:21:04.230
If he's a human, he can't be trusted.
